DESCRIPTION:Price: $5\n\nSwing\, sip and connect with Denver's IT and tech 
 professionals at Brews N Birdies\, a golf simulator bar in the Ballpark ne
 ighborhood.\n\n🗓️ Monday\, November 30\n⏱️ 7:00 PM – 10:00 PM\n
 📍 Brews N Birdies\, 2156 Larimer St\, Denver\, CO 80205 (Ballpark)\n\n
 ⛳ All three golf sim bays set up for quick challenges: closest to the pi
 n\, chipping and longest drive. No golf experience needed\, everyone rotat
 es through.\n🎯 Darts and the bar for everyone between turns\n🍸 Our g
 roup special: buy one cocktail from the new menu\, get the second 50% off\
 n🏆 Contest winners can take home prizes from Brews N Birdies\n🤝 Our 
 host makes introductions so you're never standing alone\n\nWho should come
 : developers\, engineers\, IT and security pros\, product and data folks\,
  founders building in tech\, and anyone who wants to meet them.\n\n$5 per 
 person. Limited spots\, so grab your ticket early.\n\n🅿️ Street parki
 ng around the Ballpark neighborhood\, or take the light rail and walk over
 . If you plan to drink\, please use rideshare or transit.\n\nMingle Profes
 sional Club: real connections\, no awkward name-tag energy.\n\nRSVP or app
 lication may be required. Calendar listing does not register you.\n\nhttps
 ://mingledenver.com/events/golf-and-networking-night-it-professionals-ball
 park-004645ad
