SUMMARY:Curated Networking Night at Comet Brews (Apply to Attend)
DESCRIPTION:Price: Free (apply to attend)\n\nA curated networking night for
  Denver business owners and professionals\, in the cozy taproom at Comet B
 rews in Historic Downtown Littleton. 🍻\n\nThis one is small on purpose:
  just 26 guests\, hand-picked so the room has a mix of industries instead 
 of ten people who all do the same thing. That means every conversation is 
 a potential client\, referral partner or collaborator.\n\n✅ How it works
 : Free to attend (sponsored by Living Colorado Team)\, but you need to APP
 LY. Tap Apply to attend\, answer the quick questions (company\, industry\,
  role) on our Partiful page\, and we'll confirm your spot. We keep it to 1
 -2 people per industry.\n🍺 One complimentary pour per guest\, courtesy 
 of Comet Brews (the specific beer or kombucha is to be decided)\n🤝 Our 
 host will make introductions so you're never standing alone\n\n🗓 Wednes
 day\, December 9\n🕠 5:30 – 7:30 PM\n📍 Comet Brews\, 5642 S Sycamor
 e St\, Littleton\, CO 80120 (Historic Downtown Littleton)\n\nApproved gues
 ts: if your plans change\, please let us know so someone on the waitlist c
 an take your seat.\n\nAdditional drinks and food are on your own tab. Plea
 se tip your bartender.\n\nSee you there!\n\n🏡 Thank you to our sponsor\
 , Living Colorado Team (Real Broker)! John and Kenda will be in the room a
 t select nights and are happy to answer home buying questions\, no pressur
 e.\n\nRSVP or application may be required. Calendar listing does not regis
 ter you.\n\nhttps://mingledenver.com/events/curated-networking-night-at-co
 met-brews-apply-to-attend-d722ed9c
LOCATION:Comet Brews\, 5642 S Sycamore St\, Littleton\, Littleton
URL:https://mingledenver.com/events/curated-networking-night-at-comet-brews
