SUMMARY:Professional Club Coworking Together Day (BALLPARK)
DESCRIPTION:Price: Free\n\n💻 Tired of working alone at home? Bring your 
 laptop and cowork with fellow Denver professionals for the day at Thrive W
 orkplace in the Ballpark neighborhood.\n\nThis is a small-group day\, so i
 t's easy to actually get to know everyone. Come for the whole day or drop 
 in for a few hours between calls.\n\n☕ A real coworking space: desks\, w
 ifi and a quiet place to focus\n🤝 Our host will introduce you around wh
 en you arrive\n🎓 Stay after for our free Break into Tech Sales workshop
 \, 6–9pm in the same building (separate RSVP)\n🏷️ Love the space? U
 se code NEWFRIENDS for 15% off your first Thrive day pass or meeting room\
 n\n🗓 Thursday\, December 10\n🕘 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM (come and go as y
 ou like)\n📍 Thrive Workplace\, 1415 Park Avenue West\, Denver\, CO 8020
 5 (BALLPARK)\n\n🚗 Parking: you can park in the lot next door (owned by 
 the Church of Scientology) at your own risk.\n🚆 Transit: about a 10-min
 ute walk from Union Station.\n\nGreat for freelancers\, founders\, remote 
 workers and anyone who gets more done with good company.\n\nFree to attend
 . Spots are limited\, so please RSVP and update it if your plans change.\n
 \nSee you there! 👋\n\nRSVP or application may be required. Calendar lis
 ting does not register you.\n\nhttps://mingledenver.com/events/professiona
 l-club-coworking-together-day-ballpark-80e9135f
LOCATION:Thrive Workplace\, 1415 Park Avenue West\, Denver\, CO 80205\, Bal
 lpark
