 cused professional networking built around specific industries and communi
 ties\, so it's easier to find relevant collaborators\, referrals and clien
 ts. This one is for freelancers.\n\n🗓️ Monday\, December 14\n⏱️ 6
 :00 – 8:30 PM\n📍 Adventure Time Bar\, 101 Broadway #9\, Denver\, CO 8
 0203 (Baker)\n🎟️ FREE to attend. Pay your own tab. RSVP to save your 
 spot. 21+.\n\nWe're taking over Adventure Time Bar\, Denver's only rotatin
 g-themed cocktail bar\, and they're opening on a Monday just for our group
 .\n\nWho should come: freelance developers and designers\, writers and con
 tent creators\, photographers and videographers\, marketing/social/PR free
 lancers\, consultants and fractional pros\, creatives and brand builders\,
  and anyone running a one-person business or thinking about going freelanc
 e.\n\n🤝 Give + get introductions\n⚡ Rapid connections\n🔁 Referral 
 partners\n💡 Ask the room\n\nCheck in with our host when you arrive. No 
 polished pitch or business cards needed.\n\n🅿️ Street parking: best a
 long 1st Ave. If you plan to drink\, use rideshare or transit.\n\nRSVP or 
 application may be required. Calendar listing does not register you.\n\nht
 tps://mingledenver.com/events/networking-night-freelancers-at-adventure-ti
 me-bar-baker-0b174fca
LOCATION:Adventure Time Bar\, 101 Broadway #9\, Denver\, Baker
URL:https://mingledenver.com/events/networking-night-freelancers-at-adventu
 re-time-bar-baker-0b174fca
