SUMMARY:Coffee & Networking: eCommerce at Park Cowork (WASH PARK)
DESCRIPTION:Price: Free\n\n☕ A Saturday morning coffee and networking ses
 sion for Denver's eCommerce owners and professionals\, at Park Coworking o
 n South Gaylord.\n\n🗓️ Saturday\, December 19\n⏱️ 10:00 AM – 12
 :00 PM\n📍 Park Coworking\, 1040 S Gaylord St\, Denver\, CO 80209 (Wash 
 Park)\n🎟️ FREE. Limited to 20 spots\, so please RSVP. 21+.\n\nThis mo
 rning is for people who own an eCommerce business or work in eCommerce: Sh
 opify and Amazon sellers\, DTC brand teams\, marketers and media buyers\, 
 developers\, fulfillment and logistics pros\, and the agencies and freelan
 cers who serve online brands.\n\n☕ Coffee and light snacks\n🤝 Give + 
 get introductions: share what you work on and what would help you right no
 w\n💡 Ask the room: bring a real challenge and get ideas from people who
  have been there\n👋 A Mingle host will greet you and introduce you arou
 nd\n\nGetting there: Park Coworking has no parking lot\, and street parkin
 g on Gaylord has a 2-hour limit\, so plan to park on the surrounding block
 s.\n\n🏢 Thank you to Park Coworking for hosting us!\n\nSupport the comm
 unity: become a founding member. https://mingledenver.com/membership.html\
 n\nRSVP or application may be required. Calendar listing does not register
  you.\n\nhttps://mingledenver.com/events/coffee-and-networking-ecommerce-a
 t-park-cowork-wash-park-c7f49a97
