SUMMARY:AI Step by Step Workshop 1: Business Process Audit (EAST COLFAX)
DESCRIPTION:Price: Waitlist (apply to attend)\n\n💻 Artificial Intelligen
 ce – Step by Step is a 6-week hands-on workshop series for Denver busine
 ss owners. This isn't a lecture about what AI could do. Bring your laptop\
 , and you'll leave each session with AI working inside your own business\,
  with a live instructor at your side.\n\nSmall groups only\, so everyone g
 ets hands-on help. Each workshop stands on its own\, but they build on eac
 h other\, so come to all of them if you can.\n\nWorkshop 1: Business Proce
 ss Audit\nMonday\, January 4 · 6–9pm\n\nFind out exactly where AI will 
 save your business the most time\, and leave with a plan and your first qu
 ick win.\n\nWhat we'll cover:\n• Map how your business really runs: lead
  intake\, follow-up\, scheduling\, quotes and invoices\, customer question
 s\, content\, reporting.\n• Find the time drains: spot the repetitive\, 
 rules-based tasks that eat your week and are ready for AI.\n• Score ever
 y opportunity: a simple impact-vs-effort method to rank what to automate f
 irst\, and what to leave alone.\n• Check your data: where your customer 
 and business info lives\, and what needs cleaning up before AI can use it.
 \n• Set guardrails: what should always stay human\, how to protect custo
 mer privacy\, and where to keep a review step.\n• Build your first quick
  win live: set up one AI-assisted task in class\, like answering common cu
 stomer emails or summarizing meetings into action items.\n\nYou'll walk ou
 t with:\n• A written audit of your top workflows\n• A ranked AI roadma
 p for the next 90 days\n• An estimate of the hours you could get back ea
 ch week\n• One working AI process already saving you time\n\n📍 El Pi
 ñon at La Vista Motel\, 5500 E Colfax Ave (Downstairs in a Private Room)\
 n🕕 6:00 – 9:00 PM\n🎒 Bring a charged laptop and a real task from y
 our business to work on\n🍽 Food and drinks from El Piñon available to 
 order\n\n⏳ Join the waitlist. Seats are limited so the instructor can he
 lp everyone. Join the waitlist and we'll confirm your seat and send next s
 teps.\n\nWeeks 4–6 will be announced soon.\n\nRSVP or application may be
  required. Calendar listing does not register you.\n\nhttps://mingledenver
 .com/events/ai-step-by-step-workshop-1-business-process-audit-east-colfa-a
 ded0eec
LOCATION:El Piñon at La Vista Motel\, 5500 E Colfax Ave\, Denver (Downstai
 rs in a Private Room)\, East Colfax
URL:https://mingledenver.com/events/ai-step-by-step-workshop-1-business-pro
 cess-audit-east-colfa-aded0eec
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
