SUMMARY:AI Step by Step Workshop 2: Outbound Sales Agents (EAST COLFAX)
DESCRIPTION:Price: Waitlist (apply to attend)\n\n💻 Artificial Intelligen
 ce – Step by Step is a 6-week hands-on workshop series for Denver busine
 ss owners. This isn't a lecture about what AI could do. Bring your laptop\
 , and you'll leave each session with AI working inside your own business\,
  with a live instructor at your side.\n\nSmall groups only\, so everyone g
 ets hands-on help. Each workshop stands on its own\, but they build on eac
 h other\, so come to all of them if you can.\n\nWorkshop 2: Outbound Sales
  Agents\nMonday\, January 11 · 6–9pm\n\nBuild an AI-assisted outreach s
 ystem that finds the right prospects\, writes personal messages\, and keep
 s follow-up from falling through the cracks. You stay in control of what g
 oes out.\n\nWhat we'll cover:\n• Define your ideal customer: turn "anyon
 e who needs us" into a sharp profile: industry\, size\, role\, location\, 
 and the trigger that makes them buy now.\n• Build a target list: how to 
 structure a prospect list and use AI to research each company before you r
 each out.\n• Write outreach that sounds like you: turn your best pitch i
 nto a 3–4 step sequence that AI personalizes for each prospect\, with no
  generic spam.\n• Plan your follow-up cadence: when to follow up and whe
 n to stop\, plus how AI can flag the replies that need you right away.\n
 • Handle replies faster: draft responses to common questions and objecti
 ons so hot leads get answered in minutes.\n• Stay out of the spam folder
 : sending habits that protect your reputation\, and staying compliant with
  email marketing rules.\n• Track what matters: the few numbers that tell
  you if outreach is working: reply rate\, meetings booked\, deals closed.\
 n\nYou'll walk out with:\n• A clear ideal-customer profile\n• Your fir
 st outreach sequence written and ready to launch\n• A repeatable weekly 
 prospecting routine you can run in under an hour\n\n📍 El Piñon at La V
 ista Motel\, 5500 E Colfax Ave (Downstairs in a Private Room)\n🕕 6:00 
 – 9:00 PM\n🎒 Bring a charged laptop and a real task from your busines
 s to work on\n🍽 Food and drinks from El Piñon available to order\n\n
 ⏳ Join the waitlist. Seats are limited so the instructor can help everyo
 ne. Join the waitlist and we'll confirm your seat and send next steps.\n\n
 Weeks 4–6 will be announced soon.\n\nRSVP or application may be required
 . Calendar listing does not register you.\n\nhttps://mingledenver.com/even
 ts/ai-step-by-step-workshop-2-outbound-sales-agents-east-colfax-c024abfc
