SUMMARY:What's Happening with Real Estate in Denver: Q&A with Living Colora
 do Team (RiNo)
DESCRIPTION:Price: Free\n\nThinking about buying\, selling\, or just wonder
 ing what's really going on with Denver real estate? Start the new year wit
 h straight answers.\n\nJoin John Wilkinson and Kenda Ruck of Living Colora
 do Team at REAL Brokerage\, co-hosts of the podcast Living Colorado – Ge
 tting Real (Estate)\, for a relaxed\, no-pressure evening on where the Den
 ver market stands heading into 2027\, and what it means for you.\n\n🗓
 ️ Thursday\, January 14\, 2027 · 6:00-7:30pm\n📍 The Wilderness Cowor
 king\, 3875 Steele St\, York Street Yards\, Denver\n21+ · Hosted by Mingl
 e Denver's Professional Club\n\nWhat we'll cover:\n• The state of the De
 nver market: prices\, inventory\, and interest rates heading into 2027\n
 • Buying your first home: what it really takes today\, and the steps to 
 get started\n• Selling in today's market: pricing\, timing\, and how to 
 stand out\n• Denver neighborhoods and housing trends worth watching\n•
  Open Q&A: bring your questions\, big or small\n\nWhether you're renting a
 nd dreaming\, ready to make a move\, or a homeowner weighing your options\
 , you'll leave with clear\, practical information and a few new friends.\n
 \nMember offer: Every guest can claim a free CMA (comparative market analy
 sis) to see what a home is worth in today's market\, courtesy of Living Co
 lorado Team.\n\nAbout your hosts\nJohn Wilkinson and Kenda Ruck are the dy
 namic duo behind the Living Colorado Team at REAL Brokerage and co-hosts o
 f the podcast Living Colorado – Getting Real (Estate). With backgrounds 
 in real estate\, relocation\, and international living\, they bring market
  insights\, practical guidance\, and a genuine passion for helping people 
 navigate one of life's biggest decisions. Their goal is simple: take the m
 ystery out of real estate and make finding a home in Colorado a little les
 s overwhelming\, and a lot more exciting.\n\nThe night\n• 6:00pm: Arrive
 \, grab a refreshment and mingle\n• 6:20pm: Market update and discussion
  with John and Kenda\n• 7:00pm: Open Q&A\n• 7:30pm: Wrap up\n\n📝 Ha
 ve a question for John and Kenda? Add it when you RSVP so they can come pr
 epared.\n\nSpace is limited to 50 guests\, so RSVP early.\n\nRSVP or appli
 cation may be required. Calendar listing does not register you.\n\nhttps:/
 /mingledenver.com/events/what-s-happening-with-real-estate-in-denver-q-and
 -a-with-liv-5398f1c8
LOCATION:The Wilderness Coworking\, 3875 Steele St\, York Street Yards\, De
 nver\, RiNo
URL:https://mingledenver.com/events/what-s-happening-with-real-estate-in-de
 nver-q-and-a-with-liv-5398f1c8
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
