SUMMARY:Women CEOs Coffee & Networking | CWCC x Mingle Denver (LODO)
DESCRIPTION:Price: Free\n\nStart your week in a room full of women who are 
 building something. The Colorado Women's Chamber of Commerce and Mingle De
 nver's Professional Club are teaming up for a morning of coffee and real c
 onversation with women CEOs\, founders and business owners from across Den
 ver.\n\n🗓️ Monday\, January 25\, 2027 · 8:30-10:00am\n📍 Ambler\, 
 1801 Wewatta St (by Union Station)\n\n8:30 Coffee and welcome\n8:45 Introd
 uctions and a roundtable: what's your big goal for 2027?\n9:15 Open networ
 king\n10:00 Wrap\n\nFree to attend. Coffee and food are available to purch
 ase. 21+. Space is limited\, so please register in advance.\n\nRSVP or app
 lication may be required. Calendar listing does not register you.\n\nhttps
