SUMMARY:AI Step by Step Workshop 3: Marketing at Scale (EAST COLFAX)
DESCRIPTION:Price: Waitlist (apply to attend)\n\n💻 Artificial Intelligen
 ce – Step by Step is a 6-week hands-on workshop series for Denver busine
 ss owners. This isn't a lecture about what AI could do. Bring your laptop\
 , and you'll leave each session with AI working inside your own business\,
  with a live instructor at your side.\n\nSmall groups only\, so everyone g
 ets hands-on help. Each workshop stands on its own\, but they build on eac
 h other\, so come to all of them if you can.\n\nWorkshop 3: Marketing at S
 cale: Social Media and Beyond\nMonday\, January 25 · 6–9pm\n\nTurn one 
 good idea into a month of on-brand marketing\, without hiring an agency or
  living on your phone.\n\nWhat we'll cover:\n• Teach AI your brand voice
 : create a simple voice guide so everything AI drafts sounds like your bus
 iness\, not a robot.\n• One idea\, many posts: turn a single topic\, vid
 eo or blog into posts for each platform\, an email newsletter\, captions a
 nd short-form video scripts.\n• Plan 30 days in one sitting: build a con
 tent calendar around your offers\, seasons and local events.\n• Visuals 
 made easy: use AI to brainstorm and create graphics and photo ideas that f
 it your brand.\n• Email marketing that sells: draft a newsletter and a s
 imple promo email your customers will actually open.\n• Keep it human: w
 here your personal touch matters most\, and a quick review step before any
 thing goes live.\n• Measure and improve: read your results and let AI su
 ggest what to post more of.\n\nYou'll walk out with:\n• A brand voice gu
 ide\n• A 30-day content calendar\n• Your first week of posts and an em
 ail newsletter drafted and ready to publish\n\n📍 El Piñon at La Vista 
 Motel\, 5500 E Colfax Ave (Downstairs in a Private Room)\n🕕 6:00 – 9:
 00 PM\n🎒 Bring a charged laptop and a real task from your business to w
 ork on\n🍽 Food and drinks from El Piñon available to order\n\n⏳ Join
  the waitlist. Seats are limited so the instructor can help everyone. Join
  the waitlist and we'll confirm your seat and send next steps.\n\nWeeks 4
 –6 will be announced soon.\n\nRSVP or application may be required. Calen
 dar listing does not register you.\n\nhttps://mingledenver.com/events/ai-s
 tep-by-step-workshop-3-marketing-at-scale-east-colfax-33fe651c
LOCATION:El Piñon at La Vista Motel\, 5500 E Colfax Ave\, Denver (Downstai
 rs in a Private Room)\, East Colfax
URL:https://mingledenver.com/events/ai-step-by-step-workshop-3-marketing-at
 -scale-east-colfax-33fe651c
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
