SUMMARY:Networking Night: eCommerce at Industrious (LOHI)
DESCRIPTION:Price: Free (sponsored)\n\nWelcome to Mingle Denver’s Network
 ing Nights\, a series of focused professional networking events built arou
 nd specific industries\, business models\, and professional communities. I
 nstead of trying to meet everyone in Denver at once\, each event brings to
 gether people with more in common so it is easier to find relevant collabo
 rators\, referrals\, resources\, clients\, and business connections. This 
 night is for eCommerce business owners and professionals working in the eC
 ommerce industry at companies of every size.\n\nEVENT DETAILS:\n🗓️ Th
 ursday\, January 28\n⏱️ 6:00 PM–8:00 PM\n📍 Industrious Platte Str
 eet\n2420 17th Street\, 3rd Floor\, Denver\, CO 80202 (LoHi)\n🎟️ FREE
  entry\, hosted by our sponsor for the night\, Industrious. RSVP to save y
 our spot. 21+.\n\nThis event is for people who own an eCommerce business o
 r work professionally in eCommerce\, whether you are building something on
  your own\, working at a growing brand\, supporting online sellers\, or le
 ading eCommerce strategy inside a larger company.\nYou do not need to be a
  founder to belong here.\nThis is a room for people working across the ful
 l eCommerce ecosystem\, from small independent stores to established brand
 s and large companies.\n\nWho Should Come?\n\n🛍️ eCommerce business o
 wners\n📦 Amazon and marketplace sellers\n🛒 Shopify and WooCommerce p
 rofessionals\n🚀 Direct to consumer brand teams\n📱 Social commerce an
 d TikTok Shop professionals\n📣 Performance marketers and media buyers\n
 ✍️ Email and retention marketers\n🔎 SEO and organic growth professi
 onals\n🎨 Brand and creative teams\n💻 eCommerce developers and techni
 cal teams\n📊 Analytics and conversion optimization professionals\n🚚 
 Fulfillment\, logistics and supply chain teams\n📬 Packaging and shippin
 g professionals\n🤝 Affiliate and influencer marketing teams\n💳 Payme
 nts\, finance and eCommerce technology professionals\n🧑‍💼 Consulta
 nts\, freelancers and agencies serving eCommerce brands\nWhether you are r
 unning a small online shop or working inside a national or global business
 \, this night is about meeting other people who understand online retail\,
  digital growth\, customer acquisition\, retention\, operations\, technolo
 gy\, and the realities of building revenue through eCommerce.\n\nNetworkin
 g That Gives You Something to Talk About\n\n🤝 Give + Get Introductions\
 nShare what you work on and what kind of experience\, expertise\, or conne
 ction would be useful to you right now.\n⚡ Rapid Connections\nMeet sever
 al people through short conversations\, then circle back to the connection
 s you want to explore further.\n🛒 eCommerce Matchmaking\nMeet people wo
 rking in complementary areas of the industry. A brand owner might meet a l
 ogistics specialist. A marketer might meet a developer. A marketplace sell
 er might meet someone working in paid media or retention.\n💡 Ask the Ro
 om\nBring a real eCommerce challenge. Customer acquisition getting expensi
 ve? Looking for better fulfillment? Trying to improve conversion? Expandin
 g to a new marketplace? Someone in the room may already have experience wi
 th it.\n\nUse the Mingle Barter Board\n\nThe Mingle Barter Board is our on
 line service exchange where local professionals can post what they can off
 er and what they need.\nhttps://mingledenver.com/barter\nA product photogr
 apher could trade a shoot for web development. An email marketer might exc
 hange a campaign build for brand photography. A designer could trade packa
 ging work for paid advertising support.\n\nGetting There\n\nIndustrious Pl
 atte Street is on the 3rd floor at 2420 17th Street in LoHi. Give yourself
  a little extra time to park and find the space. If you plan to drink\, pl
 ease do not drink and drive. Public transit\, rideshare\, or arranging a s
 afe ride home are all good options.\n\nCome Ready to Talk About What You A
 re Building\n\nWhat part of eCommerce do you work in?\nWhat are you trying
  to grow?\nWhat is working?\nWhat are you trying to solve next?\nYou might
  leave with a new customer\, vendor\, referral partner\, collaborator\, hi
 re\, service provider\, or simply another person in the industry who under
 stands what you are working on.\n\nWant Your Business in Front of Denver
 ’s eCommerce Community?\n\nWe are looking for sponsors and business part
 ners interested in reaching eCommerce business owners\, professionals\, ma
 rketers\, operators\, founders\, and decision makers.\nExplore Mingle Denv
 er sponsorship opportunities at:\nhttps://mingledenver.com/sponsor\nCome m
 eet the people building\, operating\, and growing eCommerce businesses acr
 oss Denver.\n\n🏢 Thank you to Industrious for hosting us in their Platt
 e Street space!\n\nRSVP or application may be required. Calendar listing d
 oes not register you.\n\nhttps://mingledenver.com/events/networking-night-
 ecommerce-at-industrious-lohi-12492690
LOCATION:Industrious Platte Street\, 2420 17th St\, 3rd Floor\, Denver\, Lo
 Hi
URL:https://mingledenver.com/events/networking-night-ecommerce-at-industrio
 us-lohi-12492690
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
